{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OVERVIEW </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone is balls! Flick your balls to victory in this billiards-like tactical RPG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/extras/breakshot_hero_promo.png?t=1748506510\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Angle your shots off of walls &amp; obstacles to find your path to success! Predictive trajectories help you make tricky shots if you can imagine them.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/extras/break-shot.gif?t=1748506510\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a cast of miniature characters! There are no micro-transactions, no FOMO - only the old fashioned grind. Every hero and monster can be recruited!  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/extras/gacha.gif?t=1748506510\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize sets of skills to execute your strategies! Will you make a robust survivor, or a long range attacker?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated maps provide you with a new challenge each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All characters are equally viable! There is no meta or tier list - the best one is the one you fancy most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer mayhem! Will you work together, or get in each others' way?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S IN THE DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the first 10 campaign levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 26 collectable figures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 re-playable environments! And 3 levels of difficulty, wowee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769620?t=1748506510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/12eae8dcca6d49d54e9e8252711a7d8f914d6a12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748506510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/654cb8a986f349589293da5ebdb08290581ba388/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748506510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/654cb8a986f349589293da5ebdb08290581ba388/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748506510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OVERVIEW </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone is balls! Flick your balls to victory in this billiards-like tactical RPG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/extras/breakshot_hero_promo.png?t=1748506510\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Angle your shots off of walls &amp; obstacles to find your path to success! Predictive trajectories help you make tricky shots if you can imagine them.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/extras/break-shot.gif?t=1748506510\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a cast of miniature characters! There are no micro-transactions, no FOMO - only the old fashioned grind. Every hero and monster can be recruited!  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/extras/gacha.gif?t=1748506510\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize sets of skills to execute your strategies! Will you make a robust survivor, or a long range attacker?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated maps provide you with a new challenge each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All characters are equally viable! There is no meta or tier list - the best one is the one you fancy most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer mayhem! Will you work together, or get in each others' way?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S IN THE DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the first 10 campaign levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 26 collectable figures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 re-playable environments! And 3 levels of difficulty, wowee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["ButterySoft, LLC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3310090","name":"Break Shot Hero"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769620/72d90480c3ab15b26704c5ad100388c46c7f7501/header.jpg?t=1748506510","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145002,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145002/movie480.mp4?t=1748492223","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145002/movie_max.mp4?t=1748492223"},"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145002/07f5aa38f88b8e88873491a0794ebb6d6484369d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748492223","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145002/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748492223","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145002